Subject: feat: the arrow points diagonally when either of two directions is
 right

When the path turns a corner within seven steps and taking the corner's
direction first meets the same path no later, the arrow points between the two
directions. New up-and-right frame in nav_arrow.png (flipped for the other
three diagonals).

